"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1318],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76122/Q7612201","priority":5,"questId":76122,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":761220101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":715426906,"text":"Columbina?","nextNodeIds":[761220102]},{"nodeId":761220102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":334165330,"text":"Huh. That's odd. Paimon's positive she heard Columbina's voice...","nextNodeIds":[761220103]},{"nodeId":761220103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1084568482,"text":"...Hyah!","nextNodeIds":[761220104]},{"nodeId":761220104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2356737810,"text":"Aaaah!","nextNodeIds":[761220105]},{"nodeId":761220105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1377426594,"text":"Greetings.","nextNodeIds":[761220106]},{"nodeId":761220106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2360425322,"text":"Another jumpscare? Not cool! If you were here, you should've just said so!","nextNodeIds":[761220107]},{"nodeId":761220107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1038645802,"text":"I thought that since you were already so familiar with this game, I should increase the difficulty this round...","nextNodeIds":[761220108]},{"nodeId":761220108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3791011226,"text":"Hmph! Paimon's gonna get you next time, just you wait!","nextNodeIds":[761220109]},{"nodeId":761220109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2543662314,"text":"Great! I look forward to it.","nextNodeIds":[761220110]},{"nodeId":761220110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1835986722,"text":"What happened to your eye mask, Columbina?","nextNodeIds":[761220111]},{"nodeId":761220111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2415042434,"text":"Oh. I guess the kuuhenki must've swiped it when we were playing earlier.","nextNodeIds":[761220112]},{"nodeId":761220112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2985292010,"text":"I don't usually need to use my eyes, so the mask makes little difference. Let them play with it if they like.","nextNodeIds":[761220113]},{"nodeId":761220113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":167736682,"text":"Oh! On that note, don't you want to go out more often?","nextNodeIds":[761220114]},{"nodeId":761220114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2241272258,"text":"You no longer need to hide from anyone, right?","nextNodeIds":[761220115]},{"nodeId":761220115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":652039770,"text":"Yes... I have plenty of time now. I can go where I wish, when I wish.","nextNodeIds":[761220116]},{"nodeId":761220116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3296505338,"text":"However, I was concerned that you might worry if you came looking for me but found that I had left without saying goodbye.","nextNodeIds":[761220117,761220118]},{"nodeId":761220117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":547713618,"text":"In this kind of situation...","nextNodeIds":[761220119]},{"nodeId":761220119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":870851338,"text":"Yeah! After all, we only need to know that you're okay.","nextNodeIds":[761220120]},{"nodeId":761220120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3663965050,"text":"I see. I will consider it, then.","nextNodeIds":[761220121]},{"nodeId":761220121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2034363626,"text":"You'll only \"consider\" it...?","nextNodeIds":[761220122]},{"nodeId":761220122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2989732338,"text":"Or maybe this is just where you want to be.","nextNodeIds":[761220123]},{"nodeId":761220123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1011003394,"text":"Everything that has happened here... I find them to be happy memories.","nextNodeIds":[761220124]},{"nodeId":761220124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2276074298,"text":"That said, I do have another reason for waiting for you here.","nextNodeIds":[761220125]},{"nodeId":761220125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2711357274,"text":"And what's that?","nextNodeIds":[761220126]},{"nodeId":761220126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2443965922,"text":"To give you a pleasant surprise.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":761220118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1816955850,"text":"You can just leave a note.","nextNodeIds":[761220119]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_360300034:2138.565,108.378,11193.690,