"text":"Luonnotar! It's really you! You're back! In the silvery flesh! Paimon thought she'd never see you again!","nextNodeIds":[761220203]},{"nodeId":761220203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2509440834,"text":"The painting we drew...","nextNodeIds":[761220204]},{"nodeId":761220204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1614261866,"text":"We used moonlight to trace this child's form, and I poured new power and new blessings therein, causing her to be reborn.","nextNodeIds":[761220205]},{"nodeId":761220205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1484979306,"text":"She no longer needs to bear my spirit. Her will is hers alone.","nextNodeIds":[761220206]},{"nodeId":761220206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":2094059522,"text":"!!!","nextNodeIds":[761220207]},{"nodeId":761220207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4093327930,"text":"Ah, she's flying over!","nextNodeIds":[761220208]},{"nodeId":761220208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1277761938,"text":"Yes. I have awakened all the memories of the time you spent together.","nextNodeIds":[761220210]},{"nodeId":761220210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":2973932538,"text":"...! ...!","nextNodeIds":[761220211]},{"nodeId":761220211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3426252186,"text":"*sniff* Paimon's so glad to have you back, Luonnotar. She promises to be nicer to you from now on...","nextNodeIds":[761220212]},{"nodeId":761220212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4263987418,"text":"Paimon wasn't expecting the surprise to be this pleasant... Paimon loves it!","nextNodeIds":[761220213]},{"nodeId":761220213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3413854298,"text":"Thank you, Columbina.","nextNodeIds":[761220214]},{"nodeId":761220214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":567169138,"text":"It wasn't much. I, too, am glad to see her again.","nextNodeIds":[761220216]},{"nodeId":761220216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":929154026,"text":"...!","nextNodeIds":[761220217]},{"nodeId":761220217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2083675010,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[761220218]},{"nodeId":761220218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2897589730,"text":"(She's still very attached to Luonnotar, but her expression is different from before.)","nextNodeIds":[761220219]},{"nodeId":761220219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4140474922,"text":"(She looks at Luonnotar not as merely a created familiar, but as a familiar friend.)","nextNodeIds":[761220220]},{"nodeId":761220220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3921276226,"text":"Go. You must miss them, surely.","nextNodeIds":[761220221]},{"nodeId":761220221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":754611530,"text":"...!","nextNodeIds":[761220222]},{"nodeId":761220222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3833462746,"text":"You're welcome to come back any time.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612202,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[20325,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1298,0],